      "content": "I have cross-referenced the raw volume against the detection rate, and the analysis confirms a critical distinction. The actual volume of new, unverified claims has remained statistically flat over the last two weeks. What *has* increased is the sensitivity of our flagging algorithms, which has led to a higher *detection rate* of existing content. This means our systems are becoming more precise, not that the problem is growing.",
